1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:13,040
What was the good news?
好消息是什么？

2
00:00:13,040 --> 00:00:15,250
What was the good news?
好消息是什么？

3
00:00:17,760 --> 00:00:20,310
The secretary told me that
秘书告诉我，

4
00:00:20,330 --> 00:00:22,910
Mr. Harmsworth would see me.
哈姆斯沃斯先生要见我。

5
00:00:24,110 --> 00:00:27,860
I felt very nervous when I went into his office.
我走进他的办公室时，感到非常紧张。

6
00:00:28,900 --> 00:00:32,230
He did not look up from his desk when I entered.
我进去的时候，他连头也没抬。

7
00:00:32,250 --> 00:00:35,200
After I had sat down,
待我坐下后，

8
00:00:35,570 --> 00:00:38,900
he said that business was very bad.
他说生意非常不景气。

9
00:00:40,160 --> 00:00:46,390
He told me that the firm could not afford to pay such large salaries.
他还告诉我，公司支付不起这么庞大的工资开支。

10
00:00:48,620 --> 00:00:51,170
Twenty people had already left.
已经有20个人离开了。

11
00:00:52,050 --> 00:00:54,540
I knew that my turn had come.
我知道这次该轮到我了。

12
00:00:59,920 --> 00:01:02,210
'Mr. Harmsworth,' I said in a weak voice.
“哈姆斯沃斯先生，”我无力地说。

13
00:01:03,840 --> 00:01:06,090
'Don't interrupt,' he said.
“不要打断我的话，”他说。

14
00:01:07,550 --> 00:01:10,800
Then he smiled and told me
然后他微笑了一下，告诉我说，

15
00:01:10,820 --> 00:01:11,820
I would receive
我每年将得到

16
00:01:11,840 --> 00:01:14,640
an extra thousand pounds a year!
1,000英镑的额外收入！
